    "title": "SDSU's Rod DeHaven named Summit League Cross Country Men's Coach of the Year - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Staff Reports ,\n1 days ago\nSDSU’s Head Coach for Track & Field/Cross Country, Rod DeHaven, was named the Summit League Cross Country Men’s Coach of the Year this week. This is the 15th time that DeHaven has earned the honor, according to SDSU Athletics, and it comes after he guided the Jackrabbit men to a league-record 11th consecutive Summit League Cross Country title on Saturday in St. Paul, Minnesota.\nRead full article\nAdd to Preferred Sources",
